    - '*':
        reason: 'npm@10.8.2 CLI tooling bundled in the node:20-bookworm-slim base image (build-time only; the server runs node, never npm, at container runtime). --exclude-base-image-vulns drops OS/apt packages, not the bundled npm node_modules. Real fix is a base-image digest bump (Dockerfile/Railway deploy change, tracked separately). Time-boxed acceptance.'
